Paper example 062: Length-preserving map

#paper: 62
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
map(A, B, n in Nat): func(
    g: func(A) -> B,
    xs: Vec(A, n),
) -> Vec(B, n): [for x in xs {g(x)}]
